{"c":[],"e":[[1,1,"<b>not in any</b> </p> <p> Or, \"which do not really honour God, but only satisfy the flesh\" (i.e. by creating a reputation for superior sanctity)."],[9,9,"<b>old man</b></p> <p><i>(See Scofield \"<a data-ref=\"Rom.6.6\">Romans 6:6</a>\")</i>."],[10,10,"<b>created</b></p> <p><i>(See Scofield \"<a data-ref=\"Eph.4.24\">Ephesians 4:24</a>\")</i>."],[14,14,"<b>perfectness</b></p> <p><i>(See Scofield \"<a data-ref=\"Matt.5.48\">Matthew 5:48</a>\")</i>."],[15,15,"<b>God</b></p> <p><b>God</b> Christ.</p> <p><b>rule</b> See <a data-ref=\"John.14.27\">John 14:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Rom.14.17\">Romans 14:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Phil.4.7\">Philippians 4:7</a>."],[16,16,"<b>grace</b></p> <p> Grace (imparted). vs. <a data-ref=\"Col.4.6\">Colossians 4:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Rom.6.1\">Romans 6:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"2Pet.3.18\">2 Peter 3:18</a>."]]}